msgid ""
"\n"
"      Are you sure that you want to submit your timed exam?\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"      Ви впевнені, що хочете завершити обмежений за часом іспит?\n"
"    "

#: openedx/edx-proctoring/edx_proctoring/templates/timed_exam/ready_to_submit.html:9
msgid ""
"\n"
"      Make sure that you have selected \"Submit\" for each problem before "
